    "detailed_description": "Have you ever wanted to take control of a vehicle in an RTS game and show them how its done?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGo head to head against up to 5 players (5 v 5) in a fully physics based simulation with automatic aiming systems.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRent your commanders and choose their vehicle. Take over any commander at any time around the battlefield to show your piloting dominance. You drive, they shoot. Don't expect the rest of your squad to follow orders though! The moment you are not in control they're going renegade and will do their own thing. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nRent different levels of commander to have access to higher grade vehicles! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nOver 20 vehicles to choose from!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUpgrade your arsenal with talent trees and power-ups available to be used in battle! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nHack facilities to get a resource generation bonus!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCall in orbital strikes to wipe out the enemy base!",
    "about_the_game": "Have you ever wanted to take control of a vehicle in an RTS game and show them how its done?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGo head to head against up to 5 players (5 v 5) in a fully physics based simulation with automatic aiming systems.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRent your commanders and choose their vehicle. Take over any commander at any time around the battlefield to show your piloting dominance. You drive, they shoot. Don't expect the rest of your squad to follow orders though! The moment you are not in control they're going renegade and will do their own thing. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nRent different levels of commander to have access to higher grade vehicles! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nOver 20 vehicles to choose from!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUpgrade your arsenal with talent trees and power-ups available to be used in battle! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nHack facilities to get a resource generation bonus!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCall in orbital strikes to wipe out the enemy base!",
    "short_description": "A sci-fi action RTS style game where you drive and pilot the vehicles. Go head to head in a 5 v 5 battle of the ages. Rent and command your squad, but don't expect them to follow orders, they're going renegade the moment you're not in control.",
